aa9824-3360-4b96-a4c6-a44ee0391201":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"template--16336839475373__02aa9824-3360-4b96-a4c6-a44ee0391201-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/wellness-capsules-category-page.png","enable_size":false,"height":80,"link":"","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}},"template--16336839475373__02aa9824-3360-4b96-a4c6-a44ee0391201-liquid-1":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<h2>Custom content<\/h2><p>Use this advanced section to build your own layouts or to add custom HTML, Liquid, or scripts.<\/p>","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--16336839475373__02aa9824-3360-4b96-a4c6-a44ee0391201-image-1","template--16336839475373__02aa9824-3360-4b96-a4c6-a44ee0391201-liquid-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"id":"","full_width":true,"space_around":false,"margin_top":75,"margin_bottom":75,"padding_around":false,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"background":"#ffffff","heading_color":"#002d72","text_color":"#0e1111"}},"1641915446cc9863b2":{"type":"featured-icons","blocks":{"16419154461dd198d9-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/smile_ltblue.png","image_width":60,"title":"Mood","text":"<p>CBD is well-known for reducing occasional stress as well as having calming and relaxing properties, it can help support and improve your general mood.<\/p><p><strong> <\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"16419154461dd198d9-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/moon_ltblue.png","image_width":60,"title":"Healthy Sleep","text":"<p>CBD may promote sleep quality and duration at night, while promoting wakefulness during the day. It could also help diminish the stress that affects you from falling asleep in the first place.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"6b5f8774-1d48-443c-9143-b4bddc7106d5":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/sheield_ltblue.png","image_width":60,"title":"Immune Function","text":"<p>Evidence suggests that CBD supports the immune system by maintaining a healthy gut microbiota, and calming stress and frustration.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"bab7810a-9858-4f36-96d4-c61475107fad":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/stomach_ltblue.png","image_width":60,"title":"Digestion","text":"<p>CBD can significantly improve your digestive health by supporting the gut and regulating your appetite. It can also help reduce stress. , <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"c822db84-b664-4a76-991d-6d11474f6cb0":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/neuro_ltblue.png","image_width":60,"title":"Stress","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"b82d552e-33ca-4af1-98cf-2736bb1f8dc5":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/eye.png","image_width":60,"title":"Energy & Focus","text":"<p>By helping manage cortisol levels and releasing dopamine and serotonin, CBD may be able to lift your energy levels, help you maintain focus, and give you mental clarity.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"b58d18b0-2b2f-470e-aad0-9fd5202452a5":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/exercise_ltblue.png","image_width":60,"title":"Exercise Recovery","text":"<p>CBD may boost your post-workout recoveryso you can perform at your optimum level. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["16419154461dd198d9-1","16419154461dd198d9-2","6b5f8774-1d48-443c-9143-b4bddc7106d5","bab7810a-9858-4f36-96d4-c61475107fad","c822db84-b664-4a76-991d-6d11474f6cb0","b82d552e-33ca-4af1-98cf-2736bb1f8dc5","b58d18b0-2b2f-470e-aad0-9fd5202452a5"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Health Benefits of Water Soluble CBD","text":"<p>Choosing water soluble CBD can have a positive effect on many aspects of your health. Research into the numerous relationships between CBD and health are still in their infancy, yet groundbreaking steps are being made and new scientific studies are regularly discovering new benefits. Water soluble CBD has a greater bioavailability than regular CBD and can have a positive effect on your outlook, wellness, sleep cycle and supports a healthy response to stress.<\/p>","bottom_text":"<p>Water soluble CBD actively works with your body’s endocannabinoid system to help maintain balance and regulate a wide range of essential functions.<\/p>","link":"shopify:\/\/blogs\/news\/cbd-101-guide","link_text":"Learn More","align_text":"left","padding":true,"wrap":true,"carousel":true,"background":"#001029","text_color":"#c8d8ee"}},"16419146342f920f5a":{"type":"featured-products","blocks":{"1641914634817b4853-0":{"type":"product","settings":{"type":"premium","banner":"","enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/nextevo_premium_pure_carton_and_bottle_cbd_2.png","title":"One-Time Purchase","price":"$44","compare_price":"","text_1":"30-count 10mg Capsules","text_2":"Single Shipment","text_3":"","button_label":"Buy Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/premium-pure-cbd-10mg-capsules"}},"1641914634817b4853-1":{"type":"product","settings":{"type":"premium","banner":"Top Seller","enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/nextevo_premium_pure_carton_and_bottle_cbd_2.png","title":"Monthly Subscription","price":"$33","compare_price":"$44","text_1":"Delivered monthly","text_2":"Pause or cancel anytime","text_3":"Save 25%","button_label":"Subscribe Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/premium-pure-cbd-10mg-capsules"}},"1641914634817b4853-2":{"type":"product","settings":{"type":"premium","banner":"Best Value","enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/nextevo_premium_pure_bottle_cbd_trio.png","title":"3-Month Subscription","price":"$92.40","compare_price":"$132","text_1":"3 Delivered every 3 months","text_2":"Pause or cancel anytime","text_3":"Save 30%","button_label":"Subscribe Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/premium-pure-cbd-10mg-capsules"}},"2d3d7f77-fc3d-4d10-98ac-b18510fef430":{"type":"product","settings":{"type":"extra_strength","banner":"","enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/nextevo_extra_strength_carton_and_bottle_cbd.png","title":"One-Time Purchase","price":"$60","compare_price":"","text_1":"30-count 15mg capsules","text_2":"Extra Strength","text_3":"Single Shipment","button_label":"Buy Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/premium-pure-cbd-15mg-capsules"}},"d85e403f-5d4a-4d1d-836a-fe3e9c6c92fd":{"type":"product","settings":{"type":"extra_strength","banner":"Top Seller","enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/nextevo_extra_strength_carton_and_bottle_cbd.png","title":"Monthly Subscription","price":"$45","compare_price":"$60","text_1":"Delivered monthly","text_2":"Pause or cancel anytime","text_3":"Save 25%","button_label":"Subscribe Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/premium-pure-cbd-15mg-capsules"}},"494e7563-7889-40cc-ad94-0fbba52c04be":{"type":"product","settings":{"type":"extra_strength","banner":"Best Value","enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/nextevo_extra_strength_bottle_cbd_trio.png","title":"3-Month Subscription","price":"$126","compare_price":"$180","text_1":"3 Delivered every 3 months","text_2":"Pause or cancel anytime","text_3":"Save 30%","button_label":"Subscribe Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/premium-pure-cbd-15mg-capsules"}}},"block_order":["1641914634817b4853-0","1641914634817b4853-1","1641914634817b4853-2","2d3d7f77-fc3d-4d10-98ac-b18510fef430","d85e403f-5d4a-4d1d-836a-fe3e9c6c92fd","494e7563-7889-40cc-ad94-0fbba52c04be"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Guaranteed Performance","text":"<p>Shop with confidence, with our 30-day guarantee. Choose how much, how often with a convenient subscription. Plus, you start earning <a href=\"\/pages\/rewards\" title=\"Rewards\">Level Up Rewards<\/a> points right away.<\/p>","align_text":"center","divider":false,"margin_top":75,"margin_bottom":75,"background":"#ffffff","heading_color":"#002d72","text_color":"#0e1111"}},"164191583148ab66dc":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"1641915831d00a823b-0":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How does CBD help with recovery?","text":"<p>The skin contains a high concentration of cannabinoid receptors, and when you apply CBD topically, it activates the endocannabinoid system through those receptors. The endocannabinoid system is responsible for many physiological processes, including muscle soreness, and immune function, <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/blogs\/news\/cbd-before-or-after-workout-how-cbd-can-help-your-workout\">which CBD can regulate and improve<\/a>.<\/p>"}},"4794c9ac-ba35-4b34-9fdf-1f354d679cfa":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Can I use CBD recovery cream alongside other CBD products?","text":"<p>Yes, you can use CBD cream with other products such as capsules, gummies and powder. But start with small amounts and build up gradually until you find the right levels for your body, and don’t exceed the recommended dosage.<\/p>"}},"196b91ac-7a99-4af0-8fc9-b94149815097":{"type":"question","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Does CBD Make You High?","text":"<p>No - CBD will not make you high. This is because CBD is a completely different compound to that of THC (the intoxicating constituent of the cannabis plant). <\/p><p>Hemp-derived CBD products are non-intoxicating and have zero psychoactive properties. High-quality CBD products can be used safely in your daily routine to support health and promote wellbeing.<\/p>"}},"f0cd3a71-ea8d-4006-a6cf-0927a6976faf":{"type":"question","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Is CBD Legal?","text":"<p>Yes, CBD products are legal but they must meet regulatory standards. The World Health Organization describes CBD as “generally well tolerated” and as having “a good safety profile”. <\/p><p>Therefore it is important to only use high-quality CBD products from trusted retailers. <\/p><p>NextEvo Naturals is committed to rigorous scientific research to evaluate the safety and efficacy of our Premium Pure CBD products. Our Smartsorb™ technology has undergone groundbreaking research at Colorado State University.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Our technology is currently being studied to evaluate the inflammation response on the body at different CBD dosage levels. Our commitment to research allows us to develop breakthrough technology<br\/>that is taking the CBD industry by storm.<\/p><p><\/p>"}},"805100b1-3456-4737-88a6-58a24e94bd8b":{"type":"question","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"What Makes NextEvo Naturals CBD Different?","text":"<p>At NextEvo Naturals, we take CBD and performance seriously. Our goal is to provide science-backed natural solutions that exist to improve your day-to-day wellness. That’s why our CBD products are backed by physicians and only use natural ingredients without the use of GMOs or fillers.<\/p><p>We’re dedicated to the evolution of wellness and the pursuit of enhanced quality allowing us to create CBD supplements that you can rely on wherever you are - we’ve got your back. <\/p><p>We have developed <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/blogs\/news\/innovative-cbd-technology\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Smartsorb™ technology<\/span><\/a> which allows the body to absorb NextEvo Naturals’s CBD within 10 minutes of ingesting and has over 4x the absorption rate of CBD than other common products. NextEvo Naturals guarantees a clean, fast-acting CBD product backed by scientific research.  <\/p>"}},"1641915831d00a823b-1":{"type":"question","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Why choose water soluble CBD?","text":"<p>Water soluble CBD is a great choice if you’re looking for a CBD product that’s fast acting and easy to consume. Water soluble CBD is discrete and adaptable. It can easily transition into your daily routine whether you’re using it in a private, social or professional environment.<\/p>"}},"8b82310a-c71b-43da-96d3-aeed8f9093a2":{"type":"question","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"What is Smartsorb™ technology?","text":"<p>Our groundbreaking Smartsorb™ technology has been developed to work with your body and increase the amount of CBD that you can absorb. This provides your body with more CBD per dose making it more effective than inferior CBD products.<\/p><p>All of our CBD products use this technology. <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/pages\/smartsorb\" title=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/pages\/smartsorb\">Click here <\/a>to find out more about Smartsorb technology™.<\/p>"}},"b43cb2f6-9691-40b4-85ac-0c69a3285adc":{"type":"question","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"What is water soluble CBD used for?","text":"<p>Water soluble CBD can be used to help with many ailments, just as with other CBD products. Our NextEvo water soluble CBD products are designed to help you be at your best, hit your personal goals and combat the stresses of daily life whatever path you’re on. It’s our aim to help you achieve next level wellness and we pride ourselves on the quality of our CBD and its ability to help you push your limits.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["1641915831d00a823b-0","4794c9ac-ba35-4b34-9fdf-1f354d679cfa","196b91ac-7a99-4af0-8fc9-b94149815097","f0cd3a71-ea8d-4006-a6cf-0927a6976faf","805100b1-3456-4737-88a6-58a24e94bd8b","1641915831d00a823b-1","8b82310a-c71b-43da-96d3-aeed8f9093a2","b43cb2f6-9691-40b4-85ac-0c69a3285adc"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"spacing":false,"margin_top":75,"margin_bottom":0,"title":"FAQs","background":"#f5f6fb","text_color":"#002d72"}},"16419156773e99dbfd":{"type":"blog-posts","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Featured Articles","blog":"news","tag":"","article_1":"","article_2":"","article_3":"","post_limit":6,"blog_show_tags":false,"blog_show_date":false,"blog_show_comments":false,"blog_show_author":false,"blog_show_excerpt":true,"view_all":true,"blog_image_size":"square","divider":false,"marg